<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>분당권 지역별 나이트 가이드 출발 보드</title>
  <meta name="description" content="분당, 야탑, 정자동, 판교 지역의 룸싸롱, 셔츠룸, 하이퍼블릭, 하퍼 관련 페이지를 출발 안내판 형식으로 정리한 지역별 링크 가이드입니다." />
  <meta name="robots" content="index, follow" />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#dff4ff" />
  <style>
    :root{
      --sky:#dff4ff;
      --sky-2:#bfe8ff;
      --ink:#18212b;
      --muted:#667281;
      --paper:#f9fcfe;
      --line:#b7c7d4;
      --accent:#ff5a36;
      --blue:#2368ff;
      --green:#0e9f77;
      --yellow:#f3b61f;
      --shadow:0 18px 45px rgba(28,53,74,.12);
      --radius:22px;
      --max:1180px;
    }
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
    body{
      margin:0;
      color:var(--ink);
      font-family:Arial,"Pretendard","Noto Sans KR",sans-serif;
      background:
        linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.38),rgba(255,255,255,.38)),
        repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,transparent 0 79px,rgba(24,33,43,.035) 80px),
        var(--sky);
      line-height:1.65;
      word-break:keep-all;
    }
    a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
    .wrap{width:min(calc(100% - 34px),var(--max));margin:0 auto}
    .topbar{
      position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;
      border-bottom:1px solid rgba(24,33,43,.15);
      background:rgba(223,244,255,.86);
      backdrop-filter:blur(16px);
    }
    .topbar-inner{height:70px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px}
    .logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-.03em}
    .logo-mark{width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--ink);color:white;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:14px;box-shadow:inset 0 -3px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.12)}
    .nav{display:flex;gap:20px;color:#42505e;font-size:14px;font-weight:700}
    .nav a:hover{color:var(--blue)}

    .hero{padding:90px 0 54px}
    .hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;gap:54px;align-items:center}
    .kicker{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:8px 13px;border:1px solid rgba(24,33,43,.16);border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.55);font-size:12px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase}
    .kicker-dot{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--green);box-shadow:0 0 0 5px rgba(14,159,119,.12)}
    h1{margin:22px 0 0;font-size:clamp(44px,7vw,88px);line-height:.98;letter-spacing:-.065em}
    h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}
    .hero-copy{max-width:690px;margin:26px 0 0;color:#536171;font-size:17px}
    .hero-note{margin-top:28px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}
    .hero-note span{padding:9px 12px;border-radius:10px;background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(24,33,43,.1);font-size:13px;font-weight:800}

    .board-preview{background:var(--ink);color:white;border-radius:26px;padding:24px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);transform:rotate(1.4deg)}
    .board-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding-bottom:16px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.15em;color:#aeb9c4}
    .live{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;color:#97f1d5;font-weight:900}
    .live i{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#58e6b8;box-shadow:0 0 0 5px rgba(88,230,184,.12)}
    .preview-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:56px 1fr auto;gap:16px;align-items:center;padding:18px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,.14)}
    .preview-row:last-child{border-bottom:0}
    .code{font-family:Georgia,serif;color:#89c8ff;font-size:13px}
    .preview-row strong{font-size:19px;letter-spacing:-.02em}
    .status{padding:6px 9px;border-radius:8px;background:#edfaff;color:#164b68;font-size:11px;font-weight:900}

    .ticker{overflow:hidden;border-top:1px solid rgba(24,33,43,.14);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(24,33,43,.14);background:#fff}
    .ticker-track{display:flex;width:max-content;animation:move 22s linear infinite}
    .ticker span{padding:15px 28px;border-right:1px solid #d8e1e8;font-weight:900;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.05em}
    @keyframes move{to{transform:translateX(-50%)}}

    .intro{padding:74px 0 30px}
    .intro-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr;gap:50px;align-items:start}
    .section-label{display:block;color:var(--blue);font-size:12px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase}
    .section-title{margin:10px 0 0;font-size:clamp(30px,5vw,50px);letter-spacing:-.045em;line-height:1.1}
    .intro-copy{color:var(--muted);font-size:16px;margin:4px 0 0}

    .directory{padding:42px 0 96px}
    .region-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:24px}
    .region-card{position:relative;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid rgba(24,33,43,.16);border-radius:var(--radius);background:rgba(249,252,254,.94);box-shadow:0 12px 32px rgba(28,53,74,.08)}
    .region-card::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0 auto 0 0;width:7px;background:var(--region)}
    .region-top{display:grid;grid-template-columns:92px 1fr;gap:18px;padding:28px 28px 22px 34px;border-bottom:1px solid #dbe5eb}
    .region-code{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center;border-radius:16px;background:var(--ink);color:white;min-height:86px}
    .region-code strong{font-size:28px;line-height:1}
    .region-code small{margin-top:8px;color:#aab5c0;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em}
    .region-card h3{margin:3px 0 6px;font-size:30px;letter-spacing:-.045em}
    .region-card p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}
    .flight-list{padding:8px 22px 22px 28px}
    .flight-link{display:grid;grid-template-columns:52px 1fr auto;gap:14px;align-items:center;padding:17px 10px;border-bottom:1px dashed #cbd8e0;transition:.2s ease}
    .flight-link:last-child{border-bottom:0}
    .flight-link:hover{transform:translateX(5px);color:var(--blue)}
    .flight-no{font-family:Georgia,serif;color:#7e8a96;font-size:12px}
    .flight-name strong{display:block;font-size:16px}
    .flight-name small{display:block;margin-top:2px;color:#8994a0;font-size:12px}
    .gate{min-width:48px;padding:7px 8px;text-align:center;border-radius:9px;background:#e8f0f4;color:#42505e;font-size:11px;font-weight:900}

    .notice{padding:0 0 100px}
    .notice-box{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:35px;align-items:center;padding:34px;border:1px solid rgba(24,33,43,.17);border-radius:24px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#fff,#edf9ff);box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
    .notice-box h2{margin:0;font-size:28px;letter-spacing:-.035em}
    .notice-box p{margin:9px 0 0;color:var(--muted)}
    .notice-stamp{width:122px;height:122px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;text-align:center;border:2px dashed var(--accent);color:var(--accent);font-weight:900;font-size:12px;transform:rotate(-8deg)}

    footer{border-top:1px solid rgba(24,33,43,.16);background:rgba(255,255,255,.45)}
    .footer-inner{min-height:110px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;color:#667281;font-size:13px}
    .footer-inner a{font-weight:900;color:var(--blue)}

    @media(max-width:900px){
      .hero-grid,.intro-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      .board-preview{max-width:650px;transform:none}
      .region-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    }
    @media(max-width:640px){
      .wrap{width:min(calc(100% - 22px),var(--max))}
      .nav{display:none}
      .hero{padding:64px 0 40px}
      h1{font-size:clamp(43px,15vw,65px)}
      .hero-copy{font-size:15px}
      .preview-row{grid-template-columns:44px 1fr}.status{display:none}
      .region-top{grid-template-columns:72px 1fr;padding:22px 18px 18px 24px}
      .region-code{min-height:72px}.region-code strong{font-size:23px}
      .flight-list{padding:4px 13px 16px 20px}
      .flight-link{grid-template-columns:42px 1fr auto;padding:15px 6px}
      .notice-box{grid-template-columns:1fr}.notice-stamp{width:100px;height:100px}
      .footer-inner{padding:24px 0;align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="topbar">
    <div class="wrap topbar-inner">
      <a class="logo" href="#top" aria-label="페이지 처음으로 이동">
        <span class="logo-mark">BD</span>
        <span>Bundang Departure Board</span>
      </a>
      <nav class="nav" aria-label="주요 메뉴">
        <a href="#guide">이용 방법</a>
        <a href="#routes">지역 노선</a>
        <a href="#notice">확인 사항</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main id="top">
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="wrap hero-grid">
        <div>
          <span class="kicker"><i class="kicker-dot"></i> Local Route Navigator</span>
          <h1>오늘의 목적지를<br><em>지역부터 선택하세요.</em></h1>
          <p class="hero-copy">분당 생활권에서 관련 정보를 찾을 때 검색 결과를 반복해서 넘기지 않도록, 지역과 업종을 한 화면의 출발 보드처럼 정리했습니다.</p>
          <div class="hero-note">
            <span>4개 지역</span><span>16개 상세 페이지</span><span>모바일 바로가기</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <aside class="board-preview" aria-label="지역 출발 보드 미리보기">
          <div class="board-head"><span>DESTINATION BOARD</span><span class="live"><i></i>OPEN</span></div>
          <div class="preview-row"><span class="code">BDG</span><strong>분당</strong><span class="status">READY</span></div>
          <div class="preview-row"><span class="code">YTP</span><strong>야탑</strong><span class="status">READY</span></div>
          <div class="preview-row"><span class="code">JJA</span><strong>정자동</strong><span class="status">READY</span></div>
          <div class="preview-row"><span class="code">PNG</span><strong>판교</strong><span class="status">READY</span></div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="ticker" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="ticker-track">
        <span>BUNDANG</span><span>YATAB</span><span>JEONGJA</span><span>PANGYO</span><span>LOCAL GUIDE</span><span>DIRECT ACCESS</span>
        <span>BUNDANG</span><span>YATAB</span><span>JEONGJA</span><span>PANGYO</span><span>LOCAL GUIDE</span><span>DIRECT ACCESS</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="intro" id="guide">
      <div class="wrap intro-grid">
        <div><span class="section-label">Board Guide</span><h2 class="section-title">복잡한 검색 대신<br>한 번에 경로 확인</h2></div>
        <p class="intro-copy">먼저 이동하기 편한 지역을 고른 다음, 해당 지역 카드에서 원하는 업종을 선택하면 됩니다. 각 링크는 별도의 상세 안내 페이지로 연결됩니다.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="directory" id="routes">
      <div class="wrap region-grid">
        <article class="region-card" style="--region:#2368ff">
          <div class="region-top"><div class="region-code"><strong>BDG</strong><small>ZONE 01</small></div><div><h3>분당</h3><p>분당 전역을 기준으로 정리한 대표 지역 노선입니다.</p></div></div>
          <div class="flight-list">
            <a class="flight-link" href="https://www.분당룸싸롱.site/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="flight-no">BD101</span><span class="flight-name"><strong>분당 룸싸롱</strong><small>대표 이용 정보</small></span><span class="gate">G1</span></a>
            <a class="flight-link" href="https://www.분당룸싸롱.site/분당셔츠룸/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="flight-no">BD102</span><span class="flight-name"><strong>분당 셔츠룸</strong><small>지역별 상세 안내</small></span><span class="gate">G2</span></a>
            <a class="flight-link" href="https://www.분당룸싸롱.site/분당하이퍼블릭/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="flight-no">BD103</span><span class="flight-name"><strong>분당 하이퍼블릭</strong><small>이용 방식 확인</small></span><span class="gate">G3</span></a>
            <a class="flight-link" href="https://www.분당룸싸롱.site/분당하퍼/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="flight-no">BD104</span><span class="flight-name"><strong>분당 하퍼</strong><small>관련 정보 바로가기</small></span><span class="gate">G4</span></a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="region-card" style="--region:#ff5a36">
          <div class="region-top"><div class="region-code"><strong>YTP</strong><small>ZONE 02</small></div><div><h3>야탑</h3><p>야탑역 주변에서 찾기 편한 지역별 연결 노선입니다.</p></div></div>
          <div class="flight-list">
            <a class="flight-link" href="https://www.분당룸싸롱.site/야탑룸싸롱/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="flight-no">YT201</span><span class="flight-name"><strong>야탑 룸싸롱</strong><small>야탑권 이용 정보</small></span><span class="gate">A1</span></a>
            <a class="flight-link" href="https://www.분당룸싸롱.site/야탑셔츠룸/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="flight-no">YT202</span><span class="flight-name"><strong>야탑 셔츠룸</strong><small>상세 페이지 이동</small></span><span class="gate">A2</span></a>
            <a class="flight-link" href="https://www.분당룸싸롱.site/야탑하이퍼블릭/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="flight-no">YT203</span><span class="flight-name"><strong>야탑 하이퍼블릭</strong><small>지역 안내 확인</small></span><span class="gate">A3</span></a>
            <a class="flight-link" href="https://www.분당룸싸롱.site/야탑하퍼/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="flight-no">YT204</span><span class="flight-name"><strong>야탑 하퍼</strong><small>관련 정보 연결</small></span><span class="gate">A4</span></a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="region-card" style="--region:#0e9f77">
          <div class="region-top"><div class="region-code"><strong>JJA</strong><small>ZONE 03</small></div><div><h3>정자동</h3><p>정자동 생활권을 기준으로 구성한 정보 연결 노선입니다.</p></div></div>
          <div class="flight-list">
            <a class="flight-link" href="https://www.분당룸싸롱.site/정자동룸싸롱/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="flight-no">JJ301</span><span class="flight-name"><strong>정자동 룸싸롱</strong><small>정자동 이용 안내</small></span><span class="gate">C1</span></a>
            <a class="flight-link" href="https://www.분당룸싸롱.site/정자동셔츠룸/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="flight-no">JJ302</span><span class="flight-name"><strong>정자동 셔츠룸</strong><small>업종별 정보 확인</small></span><span class="gate">C2</span></a>
            <a class="flight-link" href="https://www.분당룸싸롱.site/정자동하이퍼블릭/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="flight-no">JJ303</span><span class="flight-name"><strong>정자동 하이퍼블릭</strong><small>상세 안내 이동</small></span><span class="gate">C3</span></a>
            <a class="flight-link" href="https://www.분당룸싸롱.site/정자동하퍼/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="flight-no">JJ304</span><span class="flight-name"><strong>정자동 하퍼</strong><small>지역 정보 연결</small></span><span class="gate">C4</span></a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="region-card" style="--region:#f3b61f">
          <div class="region-top"><div class="region-code"><strong>PNG</strong><small>ZONE 04</small></div><div><h3>판교</h3><p>판교 업무지구와 인근 생활권을 위한 정보 노선입니다.</p></div></div>
          <div class="flight-list">
            <a class="flight-link" href="https://www.분당룸싸롱.site/판교룸싸롱/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="flight-no">PG401</span><span class="flight-name"><strong>판교 룸싸롱</strong><small>판교권 이용 정보</small></span><span class="gate">P1</span></a>
            <a class="flight-link" href="https://www.분당룸싸롱.site/판교셔츠룸/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="flight-no">PG402</span><span class="flight-name"><strong>판교 셔츠룸</strong><small>상세 페이지 연결</small></span><span class="gate">P2</span></a>
            <a class="flight-link" href="https://www.분당룸싸롱.site/판교하이퍼블릭/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="flight-no">PG403</span><span class="flight-name"><strong>판교 하이퍼블릭</strong><small>관련 안내 확인</small></span><span class="gate">P3</span></a>
            <a class="flight-link" href="https://www.분당룸싸롱.site/판교하퍼/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="flight-no">PG404</span><span class="flight-name"><strong>판교 하퍼</strong><small>지역 페이지 이동</small></span><span class="gate">P4</span></a>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="notice" id="notice">
      <div class="wrap notice-box">
        <div><h2>출발 전 마지막 확인</h2><p>이용 가능 시간, 가격, 예약 조건은 상황에 따라 달라질 수 있습니다. 실제 방문 전에는 연결된 상세 페이지의 최신 안내를 확인하는 편이 안전합니다.</p></div>
        <div class="notice-stamp">CHECK<br>BEFORE<br>VISIT</div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="wrap footer-inner"><span>© 2026 Bundang Departure Board</span><a href="https://www.분당룸싸롱.site/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">메인 안내 페이지 →</a></div>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
